# TBCGuide - Blade's Edge Mountains (66-68), Alliance
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide A_BladesEdge
@name Blade's Edge Mountains (Sylvanaar & Toshley's Station)
@faction Alliance
@levels 66-68
@zone Blade's Edge Mountains
@chapter Outland
@desc Sylvanaar, the Bladespire and Bloodmaul ogres, Evergrove, Toshley's Station and the gronn chain with Baron Sablemane.
@next Both_Netherstorm

fp Sylvanaar
bind Sylvanaar
accept The Trappings of a Vindicator | Vindicator Vuuleen.
accept Strange Brew | Borgrim Stouthammer.
accept Malaise | Daranelle.
complete Malaise | Plucked Lashh'an Feather drops from Lashh'an Talonite, Lashh'an Windwalker and Lashh'an Wing Guard and others.
turnin Malaise
accept Scratches
accept Killing the Crawlers | Sentinel Moonwhisper.
accept Into the Draenethyst Mine | Bronwyn Stouthammer.
complete Into the Draenethyst Mine | Ogres in the Draenethyst Mine.
complete Strange Brew | Bloodmaul Brutebane Brew drops from Bloodmaul Brewmaster.
turnin Into the Draenethyst Mine
complete The Trappings of a Vindicator | Vindicator Vuuleen's Blade drops from Droggam. Vindicator Vuuleen's Shield drops from Mugdorg.
complete Killing the Crawlers
turnin Strange Brew
accept Getting the Bladespire Tanked | Group quest: Bladespire Sober Defender is elite.
turnin The Trappings of a Vindicator
accept Gorr'Dim, Your Time Has Come...
complete Getting the Bladespire Tanked | Elite: Bladespire Sober Defender; bring help or skip.
complete Gorr'Dim, Your Time Has Come...
complete Scratches
turnin Gorr'Dim, Your Time Has Come...
accept Planting the Banner
turnin Getting the Bladespire Tanked
turnin Scratches
accept The Encroaching Wilderness | Rina Moonspring, Sylvanaar.
complete The Encroaching Wilderness
turnin The Encroaching Wilderness
accept Marauding Wolves
complete Marauding Wolves | Thunderlord Dire Wolf Tail drops from Thunderlord Dire Wolf.
turnin Marauding Wolves
accept Protecting Our Own
complete Protecting Our Own | Click Grove Seedling.
complete Planting the Banner | Bladespire Clan Banner drops from Bladespire Champion. Helm of Gurn Grubnosh drops from Gurn Grubnosh.
turnin Protecting Our Own
accept A Dire Situation
complete A Dire Situation
turnin A Dire Situation
accept The Bloodmaul Ogres | Commander Skyshadow.
complete The Bloodmaul Ogres
turnin The Bloodmaul Ogres
accept The Bladespire Ogres | Group quest: Bladespire Sober Defender is elite.
turnin Killing the Crawlers
turnin Planting the Banner
accept Where Did Those Darn Gnomes Go?
complete The Bladespire Ogres | Elite: Bladespire Sober Defender; bring help or skip.
turnin The Bladespire Ogres
turnin Where Did Those Darn Gnomes Go?
accept Follow the Breadcrumbs
fp Toshley's Station
accept What Came First, the Drake or the Egg? | Fizit "Doc" Clocktock.
accept Crystal Clear | Nickwinkle the Metro-Gnome.
turnin Follow the Breadcrumbs | Toshley's Station.
accept Picking Up Some Power Converters | Toshley.
complete Picking Up Some Power Converters
complete Crystal Clear
complete What Came First, the Drake or the Egg? | Proto-Nether Drake Essence drops from Proto-Nether Drake. Adolescent Nether Drake Essence drops from Adolescent Nether Drake.
turnin Picking Up Some Power Converters
accept Ride the Lightning
turnin Crystal Clear
accept Gauging the Resonant Frequency | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
accept Cutting Your Teeth
accept Ridgespine Menace
complete Ridgespine Menace
complete Cutting Your Teeth | Extra Sharp Daggermaw Tooth drops from Daggermaw Lashtail.
complete Ride the Lightning | Scalewing Lightning Gland drops from Scalewing Serpent.
complete Gauging the Resonant Frequency | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin Ridgespine Menace
accept More than a Pound of Flesh
turnin Ride the Lightning
accept Trapping the Light Fantastic
complete More than a Pound of Flesh | Ether-Energized Flesh drops from Fiendling Flesh Beast.
complete Trapping the Light Fantastic
turnin Trapping the Light Fantastic
accept Show Them Gnome Mercy!
complete Show Them Gnome Mercy! | Collection of Souls: loot Collection of Souls.
turnin Show Them Gnome Mercy!
turnin More than a Pound of Flesh
turnin Gauging the Resonant Frequency
turnin Cutting Your Teeth
turnin What Came First, the Drake or the Egg?
fp Evergrove
accept A Time for Negotiation... | Tree Warden Chawn, Evergrove (north).
turnin A Time for Negotiation...
accept ...and a Time for Action
accept Culling the Wild | Faradrella.
accept Little Embers | Mosswood the Ancient.
accept From the Ashes
accept Poaching from Poachers
complete ...and a Time for Action
complete Poaching from Poachers | Wyrmcult Net drops from Wyrmcult Poacher.
complete Culling the Wild
turnin Poaching from Poachers
complete Little Embers
complete From the Ashes | Click Fertile Volcanic Soil.
turnin ...and a Time for Action
turnin Culling the Wild
turnin Little Embers
turnin From the Ashes
level 68
note Fly to Area 52 in Netherstorm (from Toshley's Station or Evergrove), or ride east through the Netherstorm bridge.
